## Whole-file declarations, data, registration and contextual obligations (unit-1)

Creates a two-byte ArrayBuffer and a DataView with bytes0 and42. Calls getInt16 at offset0 with omitted, undefined, null, zero and empty-string littleEndian values and requires42. Object, Symbol, one and nonempty-string arguments must produce10752. Thus the assertions compare falsy big-endian and truthy little-endian interpretation of the same bytes. A failed assertion throws; normal completion reports equal zero values.


